{"id":"11ae13f6-3969-48dc-a20e-7b72a6190215","expr":"c != null","rationale":"Class parameter c must be non-null to invoke getConstructors() safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getConstructors(Class):Constructor[]","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:29.579696300Z"}
