{"id":"aed5e0bf-56fb-421f-9969-d615524ae008","expr":"c.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Interfaces do not have constructors, so for constructors to exist c should not be an interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getConstructors(Class):Constructor[]","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:29.579696300Z"}
