{"id":"dc59a3b7-ec6e-4bd1-a316-c2a066e09409","expr":"result.length == c.getConstructors().length","rationale":"The length of the result is equal to the length of the array returned by c.getConstructors().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getConstructors(Class):Constructor[]","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:29.596836844Z"}
{"id":"3fec1f35-0b1c-4140-acb5-ca7b4ff3a6e2","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getConstructors(Class):Constructor[]","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:29.596836844Z"}
