{"id":"8895417a-3e97-49cc-b4c1-5c3f940fd680","expr":"Integer.class.isAssignableFrom(c.getClass()) == false","rationale":"Generally, c is a Class object, not an Integer or primitive wrapper.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#isStaticClass(Class):boolean","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:29.913486549Z"}
