{"id":"6146947f-edc8-49e9-a3de-513378bee817","expr":"c.isArray() == false","rationale":"Array classes cannot be considered static classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#isStaticClass(Class):boolean","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:29.913486549Z"}
