{"id":"4ad2e049-cd1f-4cd1-8419-8f4aba3642b9","expr":"!c.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Typically, getConstructor is used on non-primitive classes since primitives don't have constructors.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getConstructor(Class,Class):Constructor","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:32.418020430Z"}
