{"id":"58998205-e31b-4e69-97c8-0ebc4558fb45","expr":"c != null","rationale":"The class object c must not be null to safely call its method getEnumConstants()","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getEnumConstants(Class):Object[]","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:34.443008520Z"}
