{"id":"db82e848-ab06-445c-86b1-974feb432428","expr":"result == null || result.getClass().getComponentType() == c","rationale":"The array returned by getEnumConstants should have component type equal to the class c.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getEnumConstants(Class):Object[]","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:34.459960628Z"}
