{"id":"8248aae1-46b4-45dc-abd9-2ec005359679","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method creates a new instance of a class via newInstance(), which either returns a non-null instance or throws an exception, so all returned results are non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#newInstance(Class<T>):T","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:34.961939246Z"}
