{"id":"26b4a774-bb57-4361-b8d7-67cb697e410c","expr":"c != null","rationale":"The method relies on c to obtain a method; hence c should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getMethod(Class,String,Class):Method","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:35.228326567Z"}
