{"id":"78688a87-ee2b-4f5d-a7f7-22b0f30ca370","expr":"(parameterTypes == null) || (parameterTypes.length >= 0)","rationale":"The varargs parameterTypes can be null or a valid array representing parameter types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getMethod(Class,String,Class):Method","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:35.228326567Z"}
{"id":"919f13da-f001-4ea5-ac6c-32144d560317","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"A zero-length name would be invalid for a method name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getMethod(Class,String,Class):Method","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:35.228326567Z"}
{"id":"c67fc44f-368f-41ed-aaef-1a24cf4c707d","expr":"c.getName() != null","rationale":"The class name is used for error messages, and the JDK spec guarantees non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getMethod(Class,String,Class):Method","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:35.228326567Z"}
{"id":"53ba4d6e-88d2-44e1-9fb8-50af179ac195","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method calls c.getMethod which throws when no method is found, so result is only returned when it holds a valid Method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getMethod(Class,String,Class):Method","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:35.245560266Z"}
