{"id":"cae952f5-858f-4882-a37c-473e206d3f79","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method catches exceptions and rethrows as ReflectionException, a return always means the method was found and wrapped.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.reflect.ClassReflection#getDeclaredMethod(Class,String,Class):Method","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/reflect/ClassReflection.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:05:35.309079398Z"}
