{"id":"7b0b459d-26c2-4f94-aeb1-c9805149bd4c","expr":"value == null || value.length() == 1 || value.charAt(0) <= 127","rationale":"The loop breaks upon finding a non-8-bit char, so the first character is likely within 0-127 range if loop ran less than full length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.DataOutput#writeString(String):void","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/DataOutput.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:16:18.591844318Z"}
{"id":"b0eb6aac-dae0-4cbf-b1cc-4db965ad8587","expr":"value == null || value.length() == 1 || value.charAt(value.length() - 1) <= 127","rationale":"If slow path was not taken, all characters are <= 127. This invariant suggests characters in string are probably 8-bit chars.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.DataOutput#writeString(String):void","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/DataOutput.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:16:18.591844318Z"}
{"id":"0ed9a975-0208-4132-a9a2-d75b0fd18c83","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The toArray method returns a new Array constructed from a map's values; the new Array object is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.Values#toArray():Array<V>","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/ArrayMap.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T17:16:18.904682213Z"}
